  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data estimated 300-585 K. \nPhase changes: 368.3 K, orthorhombic - monoclinic transition point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.096$ kcal/mol. \n388.36 K, melting point of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.413$ kcal/mol. \n432.02 K, second order transformation of S; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0$ kcal/mol. \n585 K, melting point of $As_{2}S_{3}$ ; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 6.874$ kcal/mol. \n717.824 K, boiling point of S to equilibrium mixture of $S_{n}$ (n = 1 to 8). \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-585 K: $Cp^{0} = 28.903 + 3.132 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.828 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=28.903\\times10^{-3}T+1.566\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+1.828\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-9.370$ \n585-850 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 31.178 + 9.586 \\times 10^{-3} T + 30.030 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=31.178\\times10^{-3}T+4.793\\times10^{-6}T^{2}-30.030\\times10^{2}T^{-1}+0.515$ \nFormation equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-368.3 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hf}^{\\circ} = -19.263 - 7.001 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} + 5.575 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 308.800 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -19.263 + 7.001 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} - 5.575 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 154.400 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 44.251 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n368.3-388.36 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -22.608 - 0.212 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} + 0.337 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 158.000 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -22.608 + 0.212 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} - 0.337 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 79.000 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 1.297 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n388.36-432.02 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hf}^{\\circ} = -71.083 + 134.008 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 129.509 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 5864.600 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -71.083 - 134.008 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 129.509 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 2932.300 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 856.983 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n432.02-585 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -99.519 + 122.290 \\times 10^{-3} T - 70.073 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 15544.100 T^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -99.519 - 122.290 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 70.073 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 7772.050 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 851.440 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n585-717.824 K: $\\Delta Hf^{\\circ} = -89.634 + 124.565 \\times 10^{-3} T - 66.846 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 12358.300 T^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gf^{\\circ} = -89.634 - 124.565 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 66.846 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 6179.150 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 855.581 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ ",
